  "configuration_id": "config_040",
  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multimodal, multiprofile models with scvi_n200 RNA encoder and imagenet_vit_l image encoder achieve high accuracy (0.724989). This experiment tests replacing the image encoder with resnet50 while keeping RNA encoder, aggregation (transformer), and fusion (weighted) unchanged. This isolates the impact of the image encoder choice, a key design decision, to determine if resnet50 offers performance benefits over imagenet_vit_l in this context."
}

